<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian Comar insurance firm reports '96 profits.</title>
<headline>Tunisian Comar insurance firm reports '96 profits.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian insurance firm COMAR made a 4.662 million dinars net profit in 1996, slightly down from 4.794 million dinars in 1995, results showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Turnover in 1996 was 50.817 million dinars compared to 43.471 million dinars in 1995.</p>
<p>The company has a capital of six million dinars and reserves worth 59.804 million dinars. ($=1.0981 dinar)</p>
</text>
